 "notes": [
  "Forms login; the UI and the scripted fetches send X-Api-Key from window.Sonarr.apiKey; config/host is never read (its response holds the API key and password) and is in the drop regex as a guard.",
  "DELETE /api/v3/tag/{id} and /api/v3/releaseprofile/{id} answer 200 with an empty body and no content type (HAR mimeType x-unknown); scope_har keeps empty replies only for 202/204 or a blank mimeType, so the two DELETEs were dropped as non-json."
